==Deployment==

Phase 1 can be deployed immediately in wallets, tooling, and SPV infrastructure without consensus change.

Phase 2 requires a separate consensus-track proposal and activation plan, ideally co-sequenced with the PQC carrier's Phase 2 to share an OP_SUCCESSx allocation block.

